meta {
  name: List vehicle locations
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/vehicle-locations
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~truckId: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

headers {
  ~X-Act-On-Tenant: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isDefined
}

docs {
  `GET /v1/vehicle-locations`

  Latest GPS position per vehicle (either capability suffices). truckId may repeat, use truckId[] or be comma-separated; unknown params are 400.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Capabilities:** `fleet:view_live_map`, `dispatch:view_operations`
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` is a list of objects with `truckId`, `gpsVehicleId`, `engineOn`, `positionDescription`, `driverName`, `fuelPercentage`; `nextCursor` pages
  - **Query `truckId`**: Truck uuid filter (repeatable, comma-separated, or truckId[]; max limited)
  - **Header `X-Act-On-Tenant`**: Platform staff only: act on this tenant (uuid) or * for all tenants (read-only).
}
